        "type": "Module",
        "name": "preamplifier",
        "description": "U1 (NE5532) serves as the low-level preamplifier stage. Operating on a single 9V supply, it requires a virtual ground reference (VCC/2 bias) for proper signal swing; the second op-amp channel within U1 is available to buffer this mid-rail voltage. The stage provides initial voltage gain to be combined with the power stage for a total system gain of 100x-200x. Audio input is received from an external source, and the output drives the power amplifier stage.",
